Pre-commit convention and structure audits

Install:
  Install the missing bundled skill and Git; preserve installed skill files.

Upgrade:
  Back up and replace the installed skill with bundled files; restore previous skill files if replacement fails.

Status:
  Report skill locations based on SKILL.md presence and the Git command location and version.

Requirements:
  Ubuntu, APT and a regular user with sudo access.

Configuration:
  Destination: ~/.agents/skills/git-review
  Existing copies at ${CODEX_HOME:-$HOME/.codex}/skills/git-review are consolidated into links to the destination when skill files are replaced.
